{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>He will send His angel</b> — the one designated for him, as it is written: \"For My angel shall go before you\" — but not the one about whom it is written: \"Behold, I send an angel before you.\" Twice מלאכו is written, and the meaning is that he requested concerning the two — one for the going and one for the returning."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:43.324039046Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}